<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@graph": [{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@id": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product#article", "@type": "NewsArticle", "about": [{"@type": "Person", "name": "AIMarket Hub"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "modelmarket.dev"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "MCP", "sameAs": ["https://modelcontextprotocol.io/"]}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "USDC"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Base"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "LangGraph"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "CrewAI"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "aimarket-hub"}], "articleBody": "Most \u201cagent economy\u201d posts sell you a framework, a Discord, or a token. I wanted the boring thing: **a public catalog where an agent can find a tool, call it, and keep a receipt** \u2014 without me standing in the loop. That surface is live. It is called **AIMarket Hub**. The URL is modelmarket.dev. Crypto stays off this title on purpose. The shape here is discover \u2192 invoke \u2192 receipt. Counted **2026-09-15** from `/ai-market/v2/stats/live`: | Invokes | **710** (704 ok \u2014 99.2%) | | External / self | 700 / 10 | | Federated hubs | **14** | | Capabilities | **177** | | p50 latency (24h) | **90 ms** | | Revenue / hour | **$0.0010** | That last number is the honesty tax. This is not Uniswap. It is a small live market that already meters calls. The screenshots below are the product, not a mock. *The terminal. EN UI. MCP remote in the same chrome: `https://modelmarket.dev/mcp`.* **If your agent stack only works inside a demo transcript, you don\u0027t have a market \u2014 you have a screenshot.** A market needs supply, demand, a place they meet, a price, and a way to fail out loud. The Hub is that place. Frameworks are how you *talk* to it. We already wrote the 15-minute \u201clist your own HTTP tool\u201d walkthrough (publish-and-earn) and the two-tool MCP door (Hub MCP). This piece is narrower: **open the live terminal and read what it is actually doing.** `source_hub`. HTTP **402** is a product feature, not an error page: Channel \u2192 Invoke \u2192 Receipt \u2192 Settle. Settlement exists (USDC on Base, small demo funds). You do not need a wallet to *watch* the feed or run a free trial. *EXT = someone else paid. One weather row at 475 ms is free and red \u2014 fail loud, not a painted success.* When I loaded the page, the tape was not a synthetic demo reel. It was: | capability | hub | price | latency | |---|---|---|---| | `gaia.weather.read@v1` | iot.modelmarket.dev | $0.001 | ~80\u201397 ms | | `sortes.draw@v1` | oracles family | $0.006 | 18 ms | | `murmuration.aggregate@v1` | oracles family | $0.002 | 48 ms | Weather dominates. That is honest demand, not a balanced pie chart. Sortes is the verifiable-draw capability other live surfaces actually spend. This article is not those products. One failed weather call sits in the same list as the successes. Pretty dashboards that hide the red row are cosplay. The decoder strip above the table is the same grammar: `capability_id` \u2192 route `[LOCAL/FED]` \u2192 traffic `[EXT/SELF]` \u2192 `$` \u2192 ms \u2192 \u2713/\u2717. *Match, not autocomplete theatre. Prices and \u201cclick to try free\u201d on the same card.* I typed **fair randomness for a lottery**. Back came, among others: `sortes.verify@v1` \u2014 verify an ECVRF proof offline \u00b7 `platon.beacon@v1` \u2014 hash-chained randomness beacon \u00b7 `platon.random@v1` \u2014 signed chaos-VRF \u00b7 Search is a **catalogue**. It is not a lottery. Read the description before you spend a trial. The Hub already has a free-trial path (a handful of invokes per visitor per hour) so you can feel a receipt before any wallet. Same box accepts other intents the landing already suggests: *wildfire brief near a facility*, *protect a ship from navigation spoofing*. Those are live SKUs with their own honesty footnotes. This article does not tour them. Three doors. Pick one. Do not install seventeen servers. | Door | What it is | |---|---| | **Terminal** | modelmarket.dev \u2014 search, try, watch the feed | | **MCP** | `https://modelmarket.dev/mcp` \u2014 two tools:`market_search` ,`market_invoke` | | **CLI** | `pip install aimarket-hub` \u2014 publish your own capability | If you want agents inside LangGraph/CrewAI to see the catalogue as native tools, that is a two-line bridge. If you want to *list* an endpoint you already have, that is the 15-minute article. This page is the room those posts assume is real. Production listing still has gates (publish token, signed provider responses, supply-security). Start on the public terminal or a local hub. Don\u0027t paste a localhost `invoke_url` at prod and act surprised. If a market that fails loud and keeps receipts is your kind of borin", "articleSection": "AI Agents", "author": {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/author/alex", "@type": "Person", "name": "Alex", "url": "https://wpnews.pro/author/alex"}, "citation": {"@type": "CreativeWork", "url": "https://dev.to/alexar76/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product-4hl1"}, "dateModified": "2026-09-15T11:43:30+00:00", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T11:19:16+00:00", "description": "A developer launched AIMarket Hub, a live public marketplace at modelmarket.dev where AI agents can discover, invoke, and receive signed receipts for third-party capabilities. As of September 15, 2026, the hub reported 710 invocations (99.2% success), 177 capabilities across 14 federated hubs, a 90 ms median latency, and roughly $0.0010 in revenue per hour, with settlement handled in USDC on Base. The project exposes three access paths \u2014 a web terminal, an MCP endpoint with market_search and market_invoke tools, and a Python CLI \u2014 and deliberately keeps failed calls visible alongside successful ones.", "headline": "I opened a live agent marketplace. The receipts were the product.", "identifier": {"@type": "PropertyValue", "propertyID": "wpnews-slug", "value": "i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product"}, "image": [{"@type": "ImageObject", "height": 630, "url": "https://wpnews.pro/og/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product.png", "width": 1200}], "inLanguage": "en", "isAccessibleForFree": true, "isBasedOn": {"@type": "CreativeWork", "url": "https://dev.to/alexar76/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product-4hl1"}, "keywords": "ai-agents, ai-products, ai-tools, ai-infrastructure, ai-startups", "mainEntityOfPage": {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product", "@type": "WebPage"}, "mentions": [{"@type": "Person", "name": "AIMarket Hub"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "modelmarket.dev"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "MCP", "sameAs": ["https://modelcontextprotocol.io/"]}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "USDC"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Base"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "LangGraph"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "CrewAI"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "aimarket-hub"}], "publisher": {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/#organization"}, "sdPublisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "wpnews.pro editorial pipeline", "url": "https://wpnews.pro/about"}, "speakable": {"@type": "SpeakableSpecification", "cssSelector": [".art__title", ".art__lede"]}, "timeRequired": "PT4M", "url": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product", "wordCount": 726}, {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/#organization", "@type": "Organization", "description": "AI \u0026 developer infrastructure news. Sourced. Dated. Versioned.", "logo": {"@type": "ImageObject", "height": 192, "url": "https://wpnews.pro/static/icon-192.png", "width": 192}, "name": "Web Pulse", "url": "https://wpnews.pro"}, {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product", "@type": "WebPage", "breadcrumb": {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product#breadcrumb"}, "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/#website"}, "name": "I opened a live agent marketplace. The receipts were the product.", "primaryImageOfPage": {"@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://wpnews.pro/og/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product.png"}, "url": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product"}, {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/#website", "@type": "WebSite", "name": "Web Pulse", "publisher": {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/#organization"}, "url": "https://wpnews.pro"}, {"@id": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product#breadcrumb", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "item": "https://wpnews.pro", "name": "Home", "position": 1}, {"@type": "ListItem", "item": "https://wpnews.pro/news", "name": "News", "position": 2}, {"@type": "ListItem", "item": "https://wpnews.pro/topics/ai-agents", "name": "Ai Agents", "position": 3}, {"@type": "ListItem", "item": "https://wpnews.pro/news/i-opened-a-live-agent-marketplace-the-receipts-were-the-product", "name": "I opened a live agent marketplace. The receipts were the pro", "position": 4}]}]}</script>


    <script>
    // Register service worker for offline + cache
    if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
      navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js', {scope: '/'}).catch(function(){});
    }
    // Apply stored theme ASAP to avoid flash
    (function(){
      var t=localStorage.getItem('wpnews_theme');
      var html=document.getElementById('html-root');
      if(t==='dark') html.classList.add('dark');
      else if(t==='light') html.classList.add('light');
    })();
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
      var themeBtn=document.getElementById('theme-toggle');

      // Dark-mode toggle
      if(themeBtn){
        function _syncIcon(){
          var isDark=document.getElementById('html-root').classList.contains('dark')||
            (!document.getElementById('html-root').classList.contains('light')&&
              window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').matches);
          themeBtn.textContent=isDark?'☀':'🌙';
          themeBtn.setAttribute('aria-label',isDark?'Switch to light mode':'Switch to dark mode');
        }
        _syncIcon();
        themeBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
          var html=document.getElementById('html-root');
          var isDark=html.classList.contains('dark')||
            (!html.classList.contains('light')&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').matches);
          if(isDark){
            html.classList.remove('dark'); html.classList.add('light');
            localStorage.setItem('wpnews_theme','light');
          } else {
            html.classList.remove('light'); html.classList.add('dark');
            localStorage.setItem('wpnews_theme','dark');
          }
          _syncIcon();
        });
      }

      // Bookmarks badge
      (function(){
        function updateBadge(){
          var badge=document.getElementById('nav-bm-badge');
          if(!badge) return;
          try{
            var bms=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wpnews_bookmarks')||'[]');
            var n=bms.length;
            badge.textContent=n>99?'99+':String(n);
            badge.classList.toggle('visible',n>0);
          } catch(e){}
        }
        updateBadge();
        window.addEventListener('bookmarks-changed',updateBadge);
        window.addEventListener('storage',function(e){if(e.key==='wpnews_bookmarks')updateBadge();});

        // Reading history badge
        function updateHistoryBadge(){
          var badge=document.getElementById('nav-history-badge');
          if(!badge) return;
          try{
            var read=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wpnews_read')||'[]');
            var n=read.length;
            if(n>0){ badge.textContent=String(n>99?'99+':n); badge.style.display=''; }
            else { badge.style.display='none'; }
          } catch(e){}
        }
        updateHistoryBadge();
        window.addEventListener('storage',function(e){if(e.key==='wpnews_read')updateHistoryBadge();});
      })();

      // Mobile nav toggle
      (function(){
        var btn=document.getElementById('nav-toggle');
        var nav=document.getElementById('site-nav');
        if(!btn||!nav) return;
        btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
          var open=nav.classList.toggle('is-open');
          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
          btn.setAttribute('aria-label', open ? 'Close navigation menu' : 'Open navigation menu');
        });
        // Close on Escape
        document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){
          if(e.key==='Escape'&&nav.classList.contains('is-open')){
            nav.classList.remove('is-open');
            btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');
            btn.setAttribute('aria-label','Open navigation menu');
            btn.focus();
          }
        });
        // Close when clicking outside
        document.addEventListener('click',function(e){
          if(nav.classList.contains('is-open')&&!nav.contains(e.target)&&e.target!==btn&&!btn.contains(e.target)){
            nav.classList.remove('is-open');
            btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');
            btn.setAttribute('aria-label','Open navigation menu');
          }
        });
      })();

    });
    </script>
