    <h1 class="art__title" itemprop="headline">I opened a live agent marketplace. The receipts were the product.</h1>
    
    <p class="art__lede" itemprop="description">A developer launched AIMarket Hub, a live public marketplace at modelmarket.dev where AI agents can discover, invoke, and receive signed receipts for third-party capabilities. As of September 15, 2026, the hub reported 710 invocations (99.2% success), 177 capabilities across 14 federated hubs, a 90 ms median latency, and roughly $0.0010 in revenue per hour, with settlement handled in USDC on Base. The project exposes three access paths — a web terminal, an MCP endpoint with market_search and market_invoke tools, and a Python CLI — and deliberately keeps failed calls visible alongside successful ones.</p>
    
    <div class="art__meta">
      
      <span class="item"><span class="k">by</span><span class="v" itemprop="author">Alex</span></span>
      <span class="item"><span class="k">read</span><span class="v">4 min</span></span>
